  "description": "The Rapide Carbon is designed to not only create speed, but to carry it.\n\nThe Rapide Carbon transfers the power directly to where you need it, providing rapid response and sharp handling to make sure you complete the hottest lap. This bike has already raced in some of the biggest XC races, as well as prove itself on the demanding marathon epics. The Rapide Carbon is your perfect podium hunter.\n\nThe Rapide CRS sees some awesome spec to bring you to your next XC challenge. Fox Float 32 Rhythm forks, WTB KOM Light wheels, and Schwalbe Racing Ralph/Ray tyre combo will deliver the speed. Sram GX Eagle 12 speed drivetrain will bring you higher up the mountain faster than ever before, with Sram Level T brakes getting you back down to the finish line.\n\nRapide Carbon frame, boost spacing\n\nFox Float 32 Rhythm 100 RL fork\n\nSram GX / NX Eagle 12 speed drivetrain\n\nSram Level T brakes\n\nWTB Pro Terra Wheelset, KOM Light Rims\n\nSchwalbe Racing Ralph / Racing Ray tubeless ready tyres",
